#: badend2:badend2_E81EC2ED_7A6F_4E49_B697_9FCC7EC85082
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d4ffbc1dea03928c96f20640220549294bc124a05c6e71d569d0b4c7531d6042
#. default-sha256: afe2cd3042958245033df7f7cc66144090d11f3695bb48784dfc32b523ef5e6c
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_E81EC2ED_7A6F_4E49_B697_9FCC7EC85082"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫You⟪k:21⟫The Departed⟪k:22⟫ could not accept the Maid’s offer."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫――受け入れてはいけない。"

#: badend2:badend2_33A5723D_E91F_4B4B_B3E7_29178B387314
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 16c60cca1422d17af1da517fe8e606a90ea657067eb336765597702359fcb83e
#. default-sha256: b34ea6b9677e0490ff7845a991fe0b745bceb59a4a3d03b2d1d7207e085eda94
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_33A5723D_E91F_4B4B_B3E7_29178B387314"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫If what she said was true, ⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫he⟪k:3⟫ could not give up on ⟪k:4⟫Your⟪k:5⟫his⟪k:6⟫ "
"search."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫それが本当なら、⟪k:1⟫「⟪k:2⟫あなた⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫死者⟪k:5⟫」は諦めてはいけないはずだ。"

#: badend2:badend2_80517542_50EF_4845_B1BE_3B78A8E57242
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fdcf5eba2a37c80f79ab85f8b64ae26238e80856213392628fac36b1d0c16680
#. default-sha256: c83c900806cd82a928ea7a5ed6174404106c15190c6a354a292229b5b16925c7
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_80517542_50EF_4845_B1BE_3B78A8E57242"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫He⟪k:3⟫ had spent years and years waiting to reunite with someone.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫"
"⟪k:6⟫Your⟪k:7⟫His⟪k:8⟫ previous attempts may have been rife with mistakes,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫「⟪k:1⟫あなた⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫死者⟪k:4⟫」はもう一度誰かに会うために、⟪k:5⟫長い年月を繰り返している。"
"⟪k:6⟫たとえそれが、⟪k:7⟫間違いの連続だったとしても……"

#: badend2:badend2_155BDA4C_4B1C_4162_82A2_B7C905A6F03B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 00c0af860b2416bca69dbcf49ee909a175b681cdba8757a7b8544c88ec2cc3f9
#. default-sha256: 112d00a1ba4b7c0af8e7597229f3c9e6579cb7465df6c951b287d0c843dc8584
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_155BDA4C_4B1C_4162_82A2_B7C905A6F03B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫but ⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫he⟪k:3⟫ could not stop trying."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫今度こそは、⟪k:1⟫見つけ出さなければならない。"

#: badend2:badend2_FC3E3AEE_F43B_4252_95DB_D3633CE93C81
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 707bf45019dd9db7dd868993f9d4e041df32c8fbb63e8781f0217da52b29cbf6
#. default-sha256: 116a96ea4c6e50b263043722a0229b528edbe42407385c11c4d5882c373382e4
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_FC3E3AEE_F43B_4252_95DB_D3633CE93C81"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Come, Master. ⟪k:3⟫Spend eternity with me in the mansion.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫We will have "
"the most wonderful time together."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫さあ……旦那さま。⟪k:3⟫わたくしと一緒に、⟪k:4⟫お屋敷で過ごしましょう。⟪k:5⟫きっと楽し"
"い日々が待っていますわ……。"

#: badend2:badend2_60B37471_CF71_4582_AC06_A3A0CD0EBC0D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b85f6ea4dc68e931b3934e881e6dc4046d601452b63f9dc594e574ab25799087
#. default-sha256: ea4b71d6219b8770c7a35ea86020d3872764afcf140cebf469f3223dfc3c13d9
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_60B37471_CF71_4582_AC06_A3A0CD0EBC0D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫These were all terrifying now."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫女中の甘い声。⟪k:1⟫冷たい指先。⟪k:2⟫氷のような微笑。⟪k:3⟫それすらも、⟪k:4⟫今となっては恐ろし"
"いものに感じられる。"

#: badend2:badend2_E920478E_380D_40E0_9D6F_C1D5F3F22207
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 862228d75d7779549e45c92be2408c263dc585c10771fbedf013b54733115b1c
#. default-sha256: fd4c455c09be34acda969e1ea0d5cb0cd6f64006048618482d90903d4bd72d4a
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_E920478E_380D_40E0_9D6F_C1D5F3F22207"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫The Departed⟪k:3⟫ had to escape."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……逃げ出さなければならない。"

#: badend2:badend2_BEEAD61C_6656_4F1B_916B_4AB6BF25FD13
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 895284434e614598298d6de11868734bb6325cbe9c06bb69d7626f98b35819d1
#. default-sha256: fcff1e2807b6b32d74c5f38ecc9c3b703d2ddf627d7a63cf93fb55b8d5e54dd2
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_BEEAD61C_6656_4F1B_916B_4AB6BF25FD13"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Had to break out of this darkness, make it outside."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫この暗闇の場所から、⟪k:1⟫外の世界へと……。"

#: badend2:badend2_DCAE5A81_0F95_44CE_96DD_DCE8DF36E8FD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 22b93fe4ba251d0f4a9051a020cc15a32b4299dab0f73e26c440e5f22281ceb1
#. default-sha256: 2bff7c72c94ed35856a11d7be6392e27c9d2e7e6b777bd4c53a7dac5314c332d
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_DCAE5A81_0F95_44CE_96DD_DCE8DF36E8FD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Master? ⟪k:3⟫What is the—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫旦那さま……？　⟪k:3⟫どうなされて――"

#: badend2:badend2_7D4AC5A9_92B5_4EB0_8126_EE36DAD7F283
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 70c90904c4c234d995106562929ed85b47871f3ad8f1b4bb43caa4989d4f4e0c
#. default-sha256: 9b228d28764f73fb2424c35b6f2d6a162c54c9c2d602918a6814c2a217b82910
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_7D4AC5A9_92B5_4EB0_8126_EE36DAD7F283"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫You⟪k:4⟫He⟪k:5⟫ brushed the Maid’s hand aside.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫As her eyes widened, "
"aghast, ⟪k:8⟫You⟪k:9⟫he⟪k:10⟫ fled from the observation tower."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫「⟪k:3⟫あなた⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫死者⟪k:6⟫」は女中の手を振り払った。⟪k:7⟫驚愕の表情を浮かべる"
"彼女を横目に、⟪k:8⟫物見の塔を後にする。"

#: badend2:badend2_A3A19873_9FF8_4F6D_ABA1_EB8E9A7EEE89
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f91cbafcb7a9c77b4c1ffb281d676835b6db0bb77aa851bef315da45ea9f8ec3
#. default-sha256: 9ea92db822e49fe4be3b07a2b5b3fda0d463e8196e7554a7cbc1caf36b418291
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_A3A19873_9FF8_4F6D_ABA1_EB8E9A7EEE89"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Down and down the spiral staircase ⟪k:3⟫You⟪k:4⟫he⟪k:5⟫ went, though not a whisper "
"of a footstep could be heard in the stone tower. ⟪k:6⟫The stairs seemed to go on forever."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫長いらせん階段を、⟪k:3⟫下り続ける。⟪k:4⟫足音は響かない。⟪k:5⟫永遠にも感じられるそれ"
"を、⟪k:6⟫ただひたすら。"

#: badend2:badend2_1971F44F_273D_4E0B_A285_3EB8D4B69B09
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a2be0ea1bca8b00c91cb4d43863bdf50e1b277bad31a53629d455423b50d58cd
#. default-sha256: e8b2cd60fb3ca9b040ec0c3db4e4de71a380db618c2e2fd529f5b29dbcedba30
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_1971F44F_273D_4E0B_A285_3EB8D4B69B09"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Down and down and down and down..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫下る、⟪k:1⟫下る、⟪k:2⟫下る、⟪k:3⟫下る……。"

#: badend2:badend2_71CD261B_E4FB_441E_A0DB_71E9AB756C0C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 542194050f894046f01a04baf86c08fd351b2a2783315fba8a71fa440126f5b4
#. default-sha256: cce7df82c052e5638ba94b82329588806bf43c490ebe149c595b1f778a2a83f2
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_71CD261B_E4FB_441E_A0DB_71E9AB756C0C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫At long last, ⟪k:3⟫You⟪k:4⟫the Departed⟪k:5⟫ arrived at the bottom, dashing from "
"the next room without a passing glance at the angel in the stained-glass window."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫やがてステンドグラスの間に到着する。⟪k:3⟫「⟪k:4⟫あなた⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫死者⟪k:7⟫」は天使の"
"絵を見向きもせずに、⟪k:8⟫走り抜けた。"

#: badend2:badend2_9452EA81_98F8_424E_9759_125A43BC5142
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 919b09325b45da6e330fa701b63f8751a018b09604cc502689334ce0d4d869e1
#. default-sha256: bbe6bb6415caed3d7b911103de8f0e99ccd1e49751f614843d56a50ecc35a116
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_9452EA81_98F8_424E_9759_125A43BC5142"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫The Maid had shown ⟪k:9⟫You⟪k:10⟫him⟪k:11⟫ around "
"the mansion, so ⟪k:12⟫You⟪k:13⟫he⟪k:14⟫ knew its layout."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫覚えている。⟪k:9⟫「⟪k:10⟫あなた⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫死者"
"⟪k:13⟫」は女中の手に導かれ続けた。⟪k:14⟫だから、⟪k:15⟫この屋敷の構造は――分かっている。"

#: badend2:badend2_3B6AC469_BC72_4416_B5FE_CBF87F7C49E1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d70cf323b134751d8c6a7390909f062eb234b6151cc2cd565891a332f90b392f
#. default-sha256: 9b37f727adc7f08a97d7e035d6a315eecf67b0a7855a5a27b0109eba0823277e
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_3B6AC469_BC72_4416_B5FE_CBF87F7C49E1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Or perhaps..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫あるいは……"

#: badend2:badend2_05B7D727_4E82_4E03_8069_3EAE9DB44E5F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a985b97a1e700a3b0e4232d6a4df9c42132461cb0615477ddd9b561c498924f9
#. default-sha256: 8bed970135dd55b453bc56bbc215035b303fb75f26d91712be1814e9f298f94a
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_05B7D727_4E82_4E03_8069_3EAE9DB44E5F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You were⟪k:2⟫he was⟪k:3⟫ familiar with it even before arriving here."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫それ以前から、⟪k:1⟫知っていたのかもしれないが。"

#: badend2:badend2_4F168C13_B50C_4B17_9524_6828D432A5A5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: da490e0b4c109f6ef3daa2ca4d3e320a13fa2909a5e294d20d6ad0fb3b9547e6
#. default-sha256: 0a67470cc3b71bc11e3f40a4c2493fd6a0affb17c826c0b23dbb36f9015339b9
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_4F168C13_B50C_4B17_9524_6828D432A5A5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫A large door came into view. ⟪k:1⟫The exit was up ahead."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫出口は目の前だ。⟪k:1⟫玄関の大扉が、⟪k:2⟫「⟪k:3⟫あなた⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫死者⟪k:6⟫」の眼前に広がる。"

#: badend2:badend2_2234A750_B2AD_4B18_BBF0_F8962C89636C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6c314b9a3fccfd3d8a560d739f68c49579484c20be3d6c724d59a3886472c572
#. default-sha256: ac449c9c8c56a92a4beda7671cbe548c826cbe6386fcf760835be43a01218539
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_2234A750_B2AD_4B18_BBF0_F8962C89636C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Master."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫―――旦那さま。"

#: badend2:badend2_3A6FE51F_0E31_4710_817A_7E3EDCC8F603
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1a72432ef4b88e0efb594e0c052dd67f15718a28137f3460dc817fd2b14b8cae
#. default-sha256: 8e9d3ac1683a06374fa2679887b4611a020c766e170aa4453504c19882bbd2ab
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_3A6FE51F_0E31_4710_817A_7E3EDCC8F603"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But the next moment, her voice seized ⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫him⟪k:3⟫ from behind.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫"
"You⟪k:7⟫The Departed⟪k:8⟫ turned back, and there stood the Maid,⟪k:9⟫wearing the same smile."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫けれどその時。⟪k:1⟫女の声が、⟪k:2⟫「⟪k:3⟫あなた⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫死者⟪k:6⟫」の背を掴んだ。⟪k:7⟫振り返"
"ると、⟪k:8⟫そこには変わらぬ微笑を浮かべた彼女がいた。"

#: badend2:badend2_0D38A2CE_82CE_43BC_B3C8_0FC474C863BD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 51c0b08fb961108de5077e06b88a80ce72dcad9384b580bacfffd35a56da3c24
#. default-sha256: cbf64bd30a459198a3d6c179890ba655d487f1875a28b9678d732cdc881e9aa5
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_0D38A2CE_82CE_43BC_B3C8_0FC474C863BD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Where do you think you are going, Master?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I told you, you mustn’t let go "
"of my hand."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫旦那さま……どこへ行こうと言うのです？　⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫だめですよ、⟪k:5⟫わたくしの手を離し"
"てしまっては……。"

#: badend2:badend2_38309D2C_2E9B_4AC0_A323_3B24BC06066F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7ac67813f8eeb9d75d9efb18b592b8c589d94d818c27f54849b318b8e4569748
#. default-sha256: 81acaea9edb1d87623c432d38b028a435574dbcc59686a11090ad6109a50b774
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_38309D2C_2E9B_4AC0_A323_3B24BC06066F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫This mansion is quite large.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫You could get lost if you go walking around "
"unaccompanied."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫このお屋敷はとても広いものですから。⟪k:3⟫うかつに歩くと、⟪k:4⟫迷子になってしまいま"
"すわ？"

#: badend2:badend2_1086B956_AF4E_4BBC_A128_A726A1941CE4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1625a9eb5f4baad74fd56cd77c23dfacb0db866120c8d4794c3cd040b3b5c5b7
#. default-sha256: d2dc85d531c0136a0ea239863600e20f639bc3286ca2b8c9c46c89412e09d4d0
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_1086B956_AF4E_4BBC_A128_A726A1941CE4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Now come, let us head back.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫And please do not let go of my hand."
msgstr ""
